                <airSeal>There is significant air loss in this house. Air sealing around plumbing and electrical penetrations and old windows will help decrease air loss. </airSeal>
                <mainWalls>Adding R-20 or more insulation to the exterior wall will result in significant savings and be eligible for a Good Energy Rebate. The best solution in this case would be to remove old siding, add insulation and replace the siding. This would also give you an opportunity to do extra air sealing from the exterior resulting in even more savings. </mainWalls>
                <windows>Replacing old windows will save money and increase comfort. </windows>
